the Mpumalanga Highveld, Middelburg serves the surrounding agricultural and industrial communities. The annual Middelburg Show celebrates rural life.\",\"population_estimate\":25000,\"archetype\":\"mining_town\"},{\"slug\":\"secunda\",\"name\":\"Secunda\",\"region\":\"Mkhondo · energy hub\",\"district\":\"Mkhondo\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":42,\"heritage\":false,\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/secunda\",\"illustrative\":true,\"lat\":-26.5167,\"lng\":29.1667,\"description\":\"Home to Sasol's massive coal-to-liquids facility, Secunda is where South Africa's energy independence was forged — literally turning coal into fuel.\",\"population_estimate\":35000,\"archetype\":\"industrial\"},{\"slug\":\"sabie\",\"name\":\"Sabie\",\"region\":\"Mbombela · forestry & tourism\",\"district\":\"Mbombela\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":15,\"opportunity_potential\":45,\"heritage\":false,\"coordinator_status\":\"assigned\",\"route\":\"/town/sabie\",\"illustrative\":true,\"coordinator_name\":\"Ntando Zwane\",\"youth_mapped\":0,\"active_signals\":0,\"open_opportunities\":0,\"lat\":-25.0917,\"lng\":30.775,\"description\":\"In the heart of Mpumalanga's forestry country, Sabie is surrounded by waterfalls, indigenous forest, and the stunning Panorama Route. This is where South Africa's timber industry meets eco-tourism.\",\"population_estimate\":5000,\"archetype\":\"forestry_town\",\"opportunities\":[{\"id\":\"opp-ecoc-sabie\",\"title\":\"EcoChar — 5-Day Charcoal Production Training\",\"type\":\"training\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-sabie\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"ecochar\"}},{\"id\":\"opp-bunt-sabie-2\",\"title\":\"BuntuBar — Mobile Bar Event Workshop\",\"type\":\"training\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-sabie\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"buntubar\"}},{\"id\":\"opp-aica-sabie-3\",\"title\":\"AI Café — Digital Access Point / CV Service Agent\",\"type\