farms, the Lowveld Botanical Garden, and Big Five game reserves. It's where the Highveld drops to the Lowveld and wildlife begins.\",\"population_estimate\":58000,\"archetype\":\"gateway_town\",\"opportunities\":[{\"id\":\"opp-fami-nelsp\",\"title\":\"FamilyHouse — Home Hospitality Host Registration\",\"type\":\"opportunity\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-nelsp\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"familyhouse\"}},{\"id\":\"opp-ecoc-nelsp-2\",\"title\":\"EcoChar — 5-Day Charcoal Production Training\",\"type\":\"training\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-nelsp\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"ecochar\"}},{\"id\":\"opp-bunt-nelsp-3\",\"title\":\"BuntuBar — Mobile Bar Event Workshop\",\"type\":\"training\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-nelsp\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"buntubar\"}}],\"stories\":[{\"slug\":\"nelspruit\",\"title\":\"Kruger Gateway Tourism Boost\",\"content\":\"Tourists passing through to Kruger now stop in Nelspruit. Our tourism guides created walking tours of the town.\",\"author_name\":\"Mandla T.\",\"id\":\"seed-nelspruit-story\",\"town_id\":null}],\"businesses\":[{\"id\":\"biz-nelsp-1\",\"name\":\"Nelspruit Tourism Office\",\"category\":\"education\",\"is_verified\":true,\"town_id\":\"town-nelsp\"}],\"events\":[{\"slug\":\"nelspruit\",\"title\":\"Lowveld Agrifood Expo\",\"description\":\"Agricultural and food expo showcasing Mpumalanga produce\",\"event_date\":\"2026-08-20\",\"id\":\"seed-nelspruit-evt\",\"town_id\":null}],\"services\":[{\"title\":\"Mbombela TVET College\",\"description\":\"Hospitality, engineering, and business programmes.\",\"price_range\":\"R4,000 - R10,000/year\",\"category\":\"education\"},{\"title\":\"Kruger Mpumalanga International Airport\",\"description\":\"Gateway to Kruger Park. Daily flights to Joburg and Cape Town.\",\"price_range\":\"R800 - R3,000\",\"category\":\"transport\"}]},{\"slug\":\"emalahleni\",\"name\":\"Emalahleni\",\"region\":\"\",\"status\":\"building\",\"render_pct\":25,\"opportunity_potential\":30,\"coordinator_status\":\"assigned\",\"route\":\"/town/emalahleni\",\"illustrative\":false,\"coordinator_name\":\"Johannes Steyn\",\"youth_mapped\":95,\"active_signals\":0,\"open_opportunities\":2,\"lat\":-25.8667,\"lng\":29.2333,\"description\":\"South Africa's coal capital, Emalahleni means 'place of coal' in isiZulu and is the energy powerhouse of the nation. The mines power the country while the community builds a future beyond coal.\",\"population_estimate\":120000,\"archetype\":\"mining_town\",\"opportunities\":[{\"id\":\"opp-eskom-emal\",\"title\":\"Eskom Graduate-in-Training Programme 2027\",\"type\":\"internship\",\"source\":\"private\",\"deadline_date\":\"2026-09-15\",\"town_id\":\"town-emal\",\"metadata\":{\"provider\":\"Eskom\"}}]},{\"slug\":\"acornhoek\",\"name\":\"Acornhoek\",\"region\":\"\",\"status\":\"building\",\"render_pct\":15,\"opportunity_potential\":45,\"coordinator_status\":\"assigned\",\"route\":\"/town/acornhoek\",\"illustrative\":false,\"coordinator_name\":\"Thabiso Mokoena\",\"youth_mapped\":0,\"active_signals\":0,\"open_opportunities\":0,\"lat\":-24.5833,\"lng\":31.1667,\"description\":\"Gateway town to the Kruger Park, surrounded by wildlife reserves and bushveld.\",\"opportunities\":[{\"id\":\"opp-insi-acornhoek\",\"title\":\"Inside.Town — Community Podcast Producer\",\"type\":\"volunteer\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-acornhoek\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"inside_town\"}},{\"id\":\"opp-fram-acornhoek-2\",\"title\":\"FrameSouth — Town Photographer / Visual Proof Creator\",\"type\":\"volunteer\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-acornhoek\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"framesouth\"}},{\"id\":\"opp-fixe-acornhoek-3\",\"title\":\"FixEasy24 — Verified Service Provider Registration\",\"type\":\"opportunity\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"deadline_date\":null,\"town_id\":\"town-acornhoek\",\"metadata\":{\"ecosystem\":\"fixeasy24\"}}]},{\"slug\":\"graskop\",\"name\":\"Graskop\",\"region\":\"panorama route\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":30,\"lat\":-24.9583,\"lng\":30.825,\"description\":\"The viewing platform at God's Window offers one of South Africa's most famous panoramas — the whole Lowveld stretching to Mozambique below. The Panorama Route through here includes Bourke's Luck Potholes and the Three Rondavels.\",\"population_estimate\":3000,\"archetype\":\"panorama_route\",\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/graskop\",\"illustrative\":true},{\"slug\":\"pilgrims-rest\",\"name\":\"Pilgrim's Rest\",\"region\":\"heritage town\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":30,\"lat\":-24.9667,\"lng\":30.75,\"description\":\"A perfectly preserved 19th-century gold mining village where the main street looks exactly as it did when prospectors struck it rich. The heritage buildings, Royal Hotel, and mining museum tell the story of the gold rush.\",\"population_estimate\":800,\"archetype\":\"heritage_town\",\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/pilgrims-rest\",\"illustrative\":true},{\"slug\":\"eelands\",\"name\":\"Eelands\",\"region\":\"conservation\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":30,\"lat\":-25.4,\"lng\":30.6,\"description\":\"Surrounded by nature reserves in Mpumalanga's bushveld, Eelands represents the province's commitment to conservation alongside development.\",\"population_estimate\":2000,\"archetype\":\"conservation\",\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/eelands\",\"illustrative\":true},{\"slug\":\"badplaas\",\"name\":\"Badplaas\",\"region\":\"mineral springs\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":30,\"lat\":-25.8167,\"lng\":30.8833,\"description\":\"A historic mineral springs resort town in Mpumalanga's lowveld, Badplaas has been attracting visitors seeking healing waters for generations.\",\"population_estimate\":3000,\"archetype\":\"mineral_springs\",\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/badplaas\",\"illustrative\":true},{\"slug\":\"lydenburg\",\"name\":\"Lydenburg\",\"region\":\"heritage town\",\"status\":\"ghost\",\"render_pct\":0,\"opportunity_potential\":30,\"lat\":-25.1,\"lng\":30.45,\"description\":\"A farming town at the foot of the Long Tom Pass, Lydenburg is known for the famous Lydenburg Heads — 1,500-year-old terracotta sculptures that are among the oldest ceramics found in southern Africa.\",\"population_estimate\":8000,\"archetype\":\"heritage_town\",\"coordinator_status\":\"recruiting\",\"route\":\"/town/lydenburg\",\"illustrative\":true}],\"hero_image\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1516426122078-c23e76319801?w=1200&q=80\",\"description\":\"The Panorama Route, Kruger Park gateway, and 13 towns in South Africa's most dramatic landscape. From God's Window to the Lowveld, Mpumalanga is where nature writes its masterpiece.\",\"coordinators\":[{\"name\":\"Johannes Steyn\",\"status\":\"active\",\"town\":\"emalahleni\"},{\"name\":\"Sharmane Fortunate Sekatane\",\"status\":\"active\",\"town\":\"bushbuckridge\"},{\"name\":\"Thabiso Mokoena\",\"status\":\"active\",\"town\":\"acornhoek\"},{\"name\":\"Ntando Zwane\",\"status\":\"active\",\"town\":\"sabie\"},{\"name\":\"Mpumi Vilakazi\",\"status\":\"active\",\"town\":\"witbank\"},{\"name\":\"Given Nkosi\",\"status\":\"active\",\"town\":\"nelspruit\"}],\"top_opportunities\":[{\"title\":\"Eskom Graduate-in-Training Programme 2027\",\"type\":\"internship\",\"source\":\"private\",\"town\":\"emalahleni\"},{\"title\":\"Inside.Town — Community Podcast Producer\",\"type\":\"volunteer\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"town\":\"acornhoek\"},{\"title\":\"FrameSouth — Town Photographer / Visual Proof Creator\",\"type\":\"volunteer\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"town\":\"acornhoek\"},{\"title\":\"FixEasy24 — Verified Service Provider Registration\",\"type\":\"opportunity\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"town\":\"acornhoek\"},{\"title\":\"EcoChar — 5-Day Charcoal Production Training\",\"type\":\"training\",\"source\":\"ngo\",\"town\":\"bushbuckridge\"}]}},\"province\":\"$5:props:town:_province\",\"lens\":\"investor\"}]\nb:[[\"$\",\"meta\",\"0\",{\"charSet\":\"utf-8\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"viewport\",\"content\":\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1\"}]]\n7:null\n9:{\"metadata\":[[\"$\",\"title\",\"0\",{\"children\":\"Witbank — Ubuntu Town Digital Twin | Ubuntu Town\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"1\",{\"name\":\"description\",\"content\":\"The old name for Emalahleni, Witbank remains in common usage — a coal mining powerhouse where South Africa's energy is forged.\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"2\",{\"rel\":\"author\",\"href\":\"https://kekelebaka.com\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"3\",{\"name\":\"author\",\"content\":\"Keke Lebaka\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"4\",{\"name\":\"keywords\",\"content\":\"Ubuntu Town,South Africa,town coordinator,opportunity infrastructure,CV engine,workpacks,proof-based work,agentic economy,Ubuntu Intelligence,Kopano,ambassador network,community coordination,small towns,townships,job matching\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"5\",{\"name\":\"creator\",\"content\":\"Keke Lebaka\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"6\",{\"name\":\"publisher\",\"content\":\"Ubuntu Town\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"7\",{\"name\":\"robots\",\"content\":\"index, follow\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"8\",{\"name\":\"googlebot\",\"content\":\"index, follow, max-video-preview:-1, max-image-preview:large, max-snippet:-1\"}],[\"$\",\"link\",\"9\",{\"rel\":\"canonical\",\"href\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za/town/witbank\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"10\",{\"property\":\"og:title\",\"content\":\"Witbank — Ubuntu Town\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"11\",{\"property\":\"og:description\",\"content\":\"The old name for Emalahleni, Witbank remains in common usage — a coal mining powerhouse where South Africa's energy is forged.\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"12\",{\"property\":\"og:url\",\"content\":\"https://www.ubuntutown.co.za/town/witbank\"}],[\"$\",\"meta\",\"13\",{\"proper